phrase: filter values appearing at least {freq} times
slot: freq int
test: list=2,3,2,4,2,5,3 freq=3
expect: => i=3 r=0.0 ok=true s="frequent count: 3" errors=0 n=3 res=[2,2,2] cache=0 hits=0
